#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:5
#: f47600ce2e9345468dc88d5d654e4295
msgid "Plane Commands in Guided Mode"
msgstr "固定翼 Guided 模式命令"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:7
#: 7970f80e050a45d09f011f5fb6ed3b33
msgid ""
"This article lists the MAVLink commands that affect the movement of a Plane "
"or QuadPlane.  Normally these commands are sent by a ground station or "
":ref:`Companion Computers <companion-computers>` often running `DroneKit "
"<http://dronekit.io/>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文列出影响固定翼或四旋翼固定翼运动的 MAVLink 命令。通常这些命令由地面站或运行 `DroneKit "
"<http://dronekit.io/>`__ 的 :ref:`伴随计算机 <companion-computers>` 发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:11
#: e067fb741f6b41ac8851d53d50982f2c
msgid ""
"The code which processes these commands can be found `here in "
"GCS_Mavlink.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/GCS_Mavlink.cpp>`__"
msgstr ""
"处理这些命令的代码可在 `GCS_Mavlink.cpp 中找到 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/ArduPlane/GCS_Mavlink.cpp>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:16
#: 9054141c662045169472c1a86f860168
msgid "Movement commands"
msgstr "运动命令"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:18
#: 9462d20fd0c245f6a07ab720eac8d5b9
msgid ""
"To command a plane to move to a particular lat, lon, alt send a "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT <plane:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` (16) within a "
"`MISSION_ITEM_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MISSION_ITEM_INT>`__ with the "
"following fields set as follows:"
msgstr ""
"要命令固定翼飞行到特定的纬度、经度、高度，请在 `MISSION_ITEM_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MISSION_ITEM_INT>`__ 消息中发送 "
":ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT <plane:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` （16），并按如下设置字段："

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:20
#: 0d23db886dcb46b1bb231077a8990dd9
msgid "\"current\" = 2 to indicate that it is a guided mode \"goto\" message"
msgstr "「current」= 2，表示这是 Guided 模式的「goto」消息"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:21
#: 0652899b73894f55b88a357cb7b0756a
msgid ""
"\"frame\" = 0 or 3 for alt-above-sea-level, 6 for alt-above-home or 11 for "
"alt-above-terrain"
msgstr "「frame」= 0 或 3 表示海拔高度，6 表示相对 Home 高度，11 表示相对地形高度"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:22
#: 66e3ffeb431c45689ed1f5d305145ebc
msgid "\"x\" = longitude * 1e7"
msgstr "「x」= 经度 * 1e7"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:23
#: 712e002d6a974d58b35ed715ad7fad8f
msgid "\"y\" = latitude * 1e7"
msgstr "「y」= 纬度 * 1e7"

#: ../../source/docs/plane-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:24
#: 4e9258a05bd04ed39d868b702d7ca505
msgid "\"z\" = altitude in meters"
msgstr "「z」= 高度（米）"

